var INSTRUCTIONS = "librocat is a durable library of memory for agents, backed by Open Knowledge Format (OKF) Markdown files. Use `search` to find concepts, `get_concept` to read one, `list` to browse, `neighbors`/`graph` to follow links, and `ingest`/`update`/`ingest_repo` to write. `rename` moves a concept and rewrites every inbound link; `delete` weeds one out; `history` reads its Git log; `weed_report` lists what to review; `thesaurus` holds the tag vocabulary; `finding_aid` writes shelf lists. Run `reindex` after external file changes and `status` to check freshness and see the live type/tag vocabulary.";
